

# <type>(<optional scope>): <summary>
#
# Types:  feat fix perf refactor test docs build ci chore revert style
# Scopes: backend frontend rules auth ops ci docs deps
#
# Summary: imperative mood ("add", not "added"), lowercase,
#          no trailing period, header 72 characters or fewer.
#
# Body (optional, after one blank line): explain what and why,
# not how. Wrap at 72 characters.
#
# Footer (optional, after one blank line):
#   Closes #12
#   Refs: docs/09-decisions.md #028
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
#   Co-Authored-By: Name <email>
#
# Full guide: CONTRIBUTING.md
